# Wave W17-V (Route 208): rest sand — rest-road pale sand: a warm pale sand running Inglenook to Apex’s south door, untroubled and plain (design-authorised: a clear connected path of pale sand running end to end). Split from Route 207’s zigzag switchback sand by the missing tread entire: this road has already climbed in its travellers’ minds; the sand just walks.
